            "value": {
              "html": "<p>Вос­поль­зу­ем­ся свой­ства­ми ло­га­риф­мов:</p><center><p><span><span data-inline-latex=\"(2x+1)\\log_5 10+\\log_5\\left(4^x-\\frac{1}{10}\\right)\\le 2x-1\\Leftrightarrow\\log_5\\left(10^{2x+1}\\cdot\\left(4^x-\\frac{1}{10}\\right)\\right)\\le\\log_5 5^{2x-1}\\Leftrightarrow\\begin{cases}4^x-\\frac{1}{10}&gt;0,\\\\10^{2x+1}\\cdot\\left(4^x-\\frac{1}{10}\\right)\\le 5^{2x-1}.\\end{cases}\"></span></span></p><p></p></center><p>Решим вто­рое не­ра­вен­ство по­лу­чен­ной си­сте­мы:</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"10\\cdot 10^{2x}\\cdot (4^{x}-\\frac{1}{10})\\le \\frac{5^{2x}}{5}\\iff 4^{x}(4^{x}-\\frac{1}{10})\\le \\frac{1}{50}\"></span> . </p></center><p>Пусть <span data-inline-latex=\"4^{x}=y\"></span>, тогда имеем:</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"y^{2}-\\frac{1}{10}y-\\frac{1}{50}\\le 0\\iff -\\frac{1}{10}\\le y\\le \\frac{1}{5}\"></span> . </p></center><p>От­ку­да, учи­ты­вая пер­вое не­ра­вен­ство си­сте­мы, по­лу­ча­ем:</p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\frac{1}{10}\\lt 4^{x}\\le \\frac{1}{5}\\iff -\\log_4 10\\lt x\\le -\\log_4 5\"></span>. </p></center>",
              "title": "Решение",
              "asset_keys": []
            },
            "operation": "rewrite",
            "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"
          },
